From: obig20 <obig20@example.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 18:28:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/18] Add Settings and Records modules with a safe storage
 wrapper

Settings validates and clamps anything read back (old saves, hand-edited JSON).
Records tracks best time and fewest falls per run id and ignores tampered data.
browserStore() falls back to memory when localStorage is blocked.
21 new tests, no browser needed.

Co-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
